      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/cc9497/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-02T19:19:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Champion Studios and Mordengrad are the winners for me ... Christopher was a genius to demand a goat! It cracks me up everytime.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I don't think there was a party for the tribunal, but hey ... It was only one song, that was kind of short for a party.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>So ... it's the last listening party until ... Earth Prime ... I hope. :)</p>",
